{"title":"ANTI THE∞HOLiC","artist":"cosMo@폭주","sourceId":"reference:1ThD3Zl4Myo3tFIAa1gI","sourceHash":"e4b9c30fb21687460c4acd784b5fdcf2d541412e5e36ed59c980789df378b95d","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":18445610,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":5.67,"end":11.31,"text":"さぁ！ 始めようか 未来の真贋鑑定を」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":11.31,"end":18.61,"text":"「ああ！ 騙されるな 永遠嘯く錬金術に」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":41.08,"end":46.95,"text":"始まりは 失亡に 呼び覚まされた心猿","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":46.95,"end":52.31,"text":"やり直し 組み直し 形変えど 可換に寄り添う終焉","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":52.31,"end":55.03,"text":"夜を統べる魔物の王は直心の呵責に潰え","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":55.03,"end":57.91,"text":"溶かした禁忌で模りし神は 忘却の彼方へ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":57.91,"end":60.77,"text":"電子の並列自我は 星枢の腕に引かれ崩落","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":60.77,"end":63.69,"text":"＝ 所詮は生命の法則逸脱した迷走","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":63.69,"end":69.19,"text":"命操る神々でさえ 何れ消え去る","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":69.19,"end":74.89,"text":"理 公式","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":74.89,"end":83.32,"text":"全ては 裏返される","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":83.32,"end":88.93,"text":"ああ！世界に生偽り付しても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":88.93,"end":94.68,"text":"ああ！破戒の罪代 積みながらに掻き消える","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":94.68,"end":100.25,"text":"求めたのは 延長線ではない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":100.25,"end":107.92,"text":"過去 未来 現在を 貫く 並行閃光","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":156.84,"end":162.5,"text":"持つ者も持たざる者も 何時か至る道の果て","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":162.5,"end":168.19,"text":"行き止まり 立ち止まり 軌跡頼り 自切という愚犯す","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":168.19,"end":170.82,"text":"約束された安定は 倦怠が全て食らい尽くす","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":170.82,"end":174.28,"text":"0消失織り成す歌姫は 見せ掛けの循環","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":174.28,"end":176.55,"text":"輪廻の恋愛譚は 乱数悪魔の讒構に堕ちる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":176.55,"end":179.32,"text":"＝ 所詮は時架けし法則黙殺した遁走","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":179.32,"end":184.91,"text":"時を操る神々でさえ 逃れられない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":184.91,"end":190.62,"text":"運命 真実","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":190.62,"end":193.59,"text":"すべては 書き換え可能の","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":193.59,"end":195.37,"text":"（資質 抑圧 搾取 弾劾 格差 気運 すら）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":195.37,"end":201.95,"text":"筋書","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":201.95,"end":207.64,"text":"ああ！崇めた過去を閉じた円環は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":207.64,"end":213.21,"text":"ああ！やがて焼き切れる儚い短絡回路","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":213.21,"end":218.85,"text":"忘れていた 世界という理不尽","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":218.85,"end":224.86,"text":"輪を抜け見える 理想の 解","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":269.51,"end":275.38,"text":"さぁ！世界を かたる 鍵を粉砕し","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":275.38,"end":281.06,"text":"さぁ！死灰と見紛う 虚飾永遠に終止符を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":281.06,"end":286.68,"text":"歴史の鎖から 解き放たれた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":286.68,"end":295.84000000000003,"text":"我らに続く者達を 望み待とう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}